 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508093,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The following table contains the lengths of four objects in both inches and centimeters. What is the constant of proportionality (centimeters divided by inches)? What does the constant of proportionality tell you in this situation?\n<table class=\"unnumbered\" summary=\".\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Object</b></td>\n<td>floor tile</td>\n<td>book</td>\n<td>table</td>\n<td>pencil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Length (in.)</b></td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Length (cm)</b></td>\n<td>60.96</td>\n<td>33.02</td>\n<td>152.4</td>\n<td>19.05</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Set up a table to make the comparisons.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Floor tile</td>\n<td>book</td>\n<td>table</td>\n<td>pencil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Length (inches)</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Length (cm)</td>\n<td>60.96</td>\n<td>33.02</td>\n<td>152.4</td>\n<td>19.05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ratio <span data-math=\"\\frac{{cm}}{{in}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{60.96}}{{24}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{33.02}}{{13}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{152.4}}{{60}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{19.05}}{{7.5}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Constant<p></p>\n<p>Divide to find the constant.</p></td>\n<td>2.54</td>\n<td>2.54</td>\n<td>2.54</td>\n<td>2.54</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The constant of proportionality is 2.54. It tells you that 2.54cm is approximately 1 inch.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The constant of proportionality (centimeters divided by inches) is 2.54. This tells you that there are 2.54 centimeters in one inch."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
